# Default PX4 SITL parameter set: no overrides.
#
# Selected when PX4_PARAM_SET is unset, so a plain `airstack up isaac-sim` leaves PX4
# entirely on its firmware defaults. Keep this file empty — anything added here applies
# to every Isaac Sim run.
#
# To use a different set, put PX4_PARAM_SET=<name> in .env or an overrides/*.env file;
# it selects px4-params/<name>.env next to this file. Entries are PX4_PARAM_<NAME>=<value>
# and PX4's rcS applies them at boot.
